cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CoherentSearch.jl"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Julia coherent harmonic-summing pulsar search over PRESTO .fft files.
  It reconstructs the pulse profile at every trial spin frequency by Fourier
  interpolating the complex amplitudes of the harmonics, inverse transforming
  them, and matched-filtering the profile against a bank of boxcar templates.
  Multi-threaded on CPUs, with an optional CUDA GPU backend.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/scottransom/CoherentSearch.jl"
keywords:
